desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Detected Pgp Private Key Block"
	title_zh: "检测到Detected Pgp Private Key Block",
	type: vuln
	level: critical
	rule_id: "source-secrets-detected-pgp-private-key-block"
	risk: "hardcoded-key"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
Something that looks like a PGP private key block is detected. This is a potential hardcoded secret that could be leaked if this code is committed. Instead, remove this code block from the commit.

### 风险类型
硬编码密钥（hardcoded-key）

### 影响
代码中直接写入加密密钥或 API 密钥，密钥一旦泄露即可被用于解密数据或伪造身份。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-798: Use of Hard-coded Credentials
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
将密钥迁移到密钥管理系统或环境变量，禁止提交到代码仓库，并轮换已暴露的密钥。

推荐修复：
Instead, remove this code block from the commit.
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.sample": <<<POS
YAKLANG_SF_POS_source-secrets-detected-pgp-private-key-block
POS
	"safefile://neg.sample": <<<NEG
# safe sample
no secrets here
just regular code
NEG
)

${*}.pattern_regex(/(?:-----BEGIN PGP PRIVATE KEY BLOCK-----)|YAKLANG_SF_POS_source\-secrets\-detected\-pgp\-private\-key\-block/) as $p0
$p0 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "critical",
	title: "Detected Pgp Private Key Block",
	title_zh: "检测到Detected Pgp Private Key Block",
	message: "Detected Pgp Private Key Block",
}
